A||N||1||TRL46202||Questions on changing interior color etc..............||||1||
Z||000000||TRL46202||09-12-2000||02:35 PM||||Thinking of buying an 86GT (Gold) w/Tan,brown interior. Want to repaint the car and change the color of the interior. First, the car runs good, has an exhaust leak and does need a new exhaust system. It has new brakes and tires and is driven daily. I checked and the guy is the 3rd owner, the 2nd owner said it had an engine fire, you can tell buy the different color deck lid but the wing is the original and the plastic clear GT panels are broke or melted, the engine was pulled and the tranny too and both where replaced by GM. They stated that it was a electrical fire. The things I want to do are: Repaint the car, change interior color, get a new wire harness (if possible) it still looked bad and new quarter windows, they don't have to be clear. he's asking $1,400.00 but I think I can get it for $1,200.00....Let me know what you all think. Again the interior is ok and most of it just needs cleaning.<P>Thanks, Tom||||reg||1
Z||000001||HugGRRRFiero||09-12-2000||03:06 PM||||Don't know if your looking to recolor the interior black or change it from tan to the grey?  I'm assuming you want to change it to black if you say it's in good condition.  <P>You'll probably need to find another 86GT with the same options and tranny to find a good wiring harness.  You might be able to find one with a siezed engine cheap since you won't need a running engine.  If you find one with good side windows and other parts you need that would be a plus.<P>The harness swap isn't too big of a job, especially if you can save the tailight harness and change everything else.<P>$1,200 doesn't sound too bad.  Not trying to say "buy, buy, buy" because there are a lot of things like mileage that can affect the value.  Remember you will have the cost of a new paintjob, and the possibility of a parts car to find.  Think about those and the total amount you want to spend.  Hope this gives you some insight.  If you still have questions or more info on the car go ahead and post them here.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">   <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
